yyjson 0.12.0, unmodified upstream src/yyjson.c, src/yyjson.h and LICENSE.
Source: https://github.com/ibireme/yyjson/tree/0.12.0
License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory).

The harness uses strict JSON, retains raw numeric literals, and rejects duplicate
keys, embedded NUL strings, and nesting deeper than 128 in its owning-tree adapter.
No compiler-specific feature is required by hark. yyjson detects the target and
provides portable fallbacks internally. No build-time download is performed.
